  "constraints_html": "<ul>\n\t<li><code>1 &lt;= nums.length &lt;= 10<sup>5</sup></code></li>\n\t<li><code>-2<sup>31</sup> &lt;= nums[i] &lt;= 2<sup>31</sup> - 1</code></li>\n\t<li><code>0 &lt;= k &lt;= 10<sup>5</sup></code></li>\n</ul>",
  "source": "https://github.com/doocs/leetcode/blob/2104ae8bdd661a1ebb6b5c703f050b8060b51e32/solution/0100-0199/0189.Rotate%20Array/README.md",
